# Paying Lip Service (windurst 60), completion parity: 479's finish while accepted is npcUtil.completeQuest step for
# step (the title; no fameArea, so no fame), ending in the raw player:completeQuest, so a GM's Quest[2][60]Prog survives
# the completion (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) beside
# Tapoh Lihzeh.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=49.5,-3.75,54.4 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.PayingLipService accepted
item BeehiveChip x3
login
charvar Quest[2][60]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Tapoh_Lihzeh BeehiveChip x3       # 479
finish option=0                         # Kisser Make-Upper; completed; 150 gil; the chips taken; Prog kept
